[gd_scene load_steps=5 format=3]

; Cutting / prep station: a kitchen cabinet (the plain "counter" model, so the
; station tiles flush into a counter run) with a cutting board, a knife lying on
; it and a small bowl beside it. Every child is a Kenney model used as-is; the
; whole thing is scaled by 2 at runtime (FurnitureDef.scale_mult), so the food
; kit children sit at 0.25-0.35 to match the in-game food size (world 0.5-0.7).
;
; Native kit units: the cabinet is 0.43 x 0.45 x 0.45 (its door faces +Z), so
; the composition stays inside that box => 1x1 cells after the x2 scale.

